GeoNames
https://www.geonames.org

CastAir's town search and place naming use the GeoNames "cities5000" place
list (places with more than 5000 inhabitants), with its region and country
names, packed into server/data/places.tsv.gz by server/scripts/build-places.mjs.

GeoNames data is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The data was reformatted
(columns joined and trimmed); it is otherwise as published by GeoNames.
